      "id": "start-frequency-interpolation",
      "name": "StartFrequencyInterpolation",
      "category": "InterpolatedOnePole",
      "signature": "StartFrequencyInterpolation(Target, In Target Frequency, Interp Length)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FInterpolatedLPF*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Target Frequency",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Interp Length",
          "type": "Int",
          "default": "1"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "StartFrequencyInterpolation():\nIntended use: call once at the beginning of callback, pass the callback length\nthen call ProcessAudioFrame() exactly \"InterpLength\" number of times\nAt the end of the callback, call StopFrequencyInterpolation()\nFailing to call StopFrequencyInterpolation() after more than InterpLength calls to ProcessAudioFrame\nwill cause the filter to become unstable and blow up to +/- inf!"
    },
